* movea without a size is long in both Microware assemblers (gas: word); adda, suba, cmpa and
* move to an address register stay word.
* fixed: 63bfc80 2026-10-11 r68togas: movea without a size is long
* expect text: 206f0004 d0c090c0 b0c0306f 00042241
 psect movea_size,0,0,0,0,0
 movea 4(sp),a0
 adda d0,a0
 suba d0,a0
 cmpa d0,a0
 move 4(sp),a0
 move.l d1,a1
 ends
